      "september-attacks"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Investors compared famous fund managers with indexes. Computer competition, an internet attack and Tiger Woods’s professional debut also drew attention.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The route to the final value mattered. A positive five-year total could include losses that would have been hard to sit through.",
    "what_faded_away": "An athlete’s promising career did not guarantee a rising sponsor’s share price. The most popular investment manager was not automatically the best choice either.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The exact technology-stock reversals and the September 11 attacks were unknown. No confident starting story removed those risks.",
